----------------------------------------------------
The harness's own nginx.conf (mutation reverted) was diffed against a
completely fresh three-script-plus-offline.patch application to the pristine
vendored donor:

  $ diff n2-harness/conf/nginx.conf.good n2-verify-fresh2/nginx.conf
  Files are identical

Confirms the restore is the identical bytes a clean chained run of all three
production patch scripts (patch_pkg_location.py, patch_live_hls_location.py,
patch_retire_go2rtc_routes.py) plus offline.patch would produce, not merely a
block that looks the same.

